        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">How the process works</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">The first session covers what brings you here, your history and what you hope for. We then agree on the approach that suits you — <a href="/en/services/cbt-therapy.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">CBT</a>, <a href="/en/services/act-therapy.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">ACT</a> or <a href="/en/services/psychodynamic-therapy.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">psychodynamic therapy</a> — along with how often you will meet. For the session format itself, see <a href="/en/services/individual-therapy.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">individual therapy</a>.</p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Assessment and Plan</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">The opening sessions clarify the picture and set goals and approach together.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Evidence-Based Methods</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">We prefer approaches whose effectiveness for your particular difficulty is supported by research.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Confidentiality</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">What is said in session is kept confidential within professional ethics and the legal framework.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
