        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">What do adults most often come with?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">Reasons for coming rarely sit under a single heading. Work, relationships and the space left for yourself tend to come under strain at the same time. These are the subjects we work on most often with adults.</p>
