          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary shrink-0 mt-2.5"></span>Relationship difficulties and recurring conflict</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary shrink-0 mt-2.5"></span>Grief, loss and major life changes</li>
