    <section class="py-16 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">What happens in the first meeting?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">The first meeting is an introduction. We talk about what brought you here, what you are hoping for and the significant points in your history. It is not binding; you decide about continuing afterwards.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">You do not have to talk about anything you do not feel ready for. Where we start is decided together.</p>
      </div>
