    <section class="py-16 bg-warm">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">Should I see a psychologist or a psychiatrist?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">A psychologist does not prescribe medication; they carry out psychotherapy. A psychiatrist is a physician and can prescribe where that is needed. In moderate and severe presentations the two often run alongside each other.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">If you are unsure where to start, we can look at it together in the first meeting. A fuller comparison: <a href="/en/blog/psychologist-or-psychiatrist.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">Psychologist or Psychiatrist?</a></p>
      </div>
